#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:213 28f1933678854354b8ef357adcfdd380
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The fixed overhead is ``PF_ECDH_SEAL_OVERHEAD`` (44 bytes). Empty "
"plaintext is allowed. A failed tag check returns ``PF_ERR_AUTH_FAILED`` "
"and no plaintext is returned. On success the output buffer is "
"``malloc``-ed and the caller frees it."
msgstr ""
"고정 오버헤드는 ``SS_ECDH_SEAL_OVERHEAD``(44바이트)입니다. 빈 일반 텍스트가 허용됩니다. 실패한 태그 확인은"
" ``SS_ERR_AUTH_FAILED``를 반환하고 일반 텍스트는 반환되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:218 9a7c6cc7b5a94e5fac26bc6802310183
msgid ""
"ECDH key pairs can be persisted with ``pf_ecdh_keypair_write_priv`` and "
"``pf_ecdh_keypair_read_priv`` (PKCS#8 PEM, optionally passphrase-"
